      "side": 1,
      "message": "What about handling such case in `handleDeviceDisconnection` context ? and e.g. remove Sink Metadata for device if it\u0027s intended disconnection, for not intended check if all devices from \"target group\" are disconnected then remove sink for all of them.\n\nOf cource `handleDeviceDisconnection` would have to be split into part of \"local broadcast\" and \"external broadcast\" sink disconnection handling. What\u0027s more - sink could be a part of local and external broadcast (this is possible).",
